 divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $847,$ we have that \n\n$$\n84-2(7)=84-14=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $847$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432787 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "023e8ca5-d704-5d99-b064-aeb77c93d254" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432700} {:answer/id #uuid "2022291e-1db1-5780-8ab9-edc149d22ea2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II  and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432709} {:answer/id #uuid "2e82d512-84f1-533e-a037-9f343f12a528" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432714} {:answer/id #uuid "dc070f7d-66ad-5425-aa52-08341f6869d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432757} {:answer/id #uuid "f8032825-bbee-58b1-b581-15121282664c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I  and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432766}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc070f7d-66ad-5425-aa52-08341f6869d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432757} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad4a570e-3aef-54f0-a307-e26d4ea86c53" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432778}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6daa78eb-7b75-5f11-9d14-7