49$\n\nII. $3\\,121\\,557$\n\nIII. $99\\,125\\,041$" :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $3$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $187\\,349$ is\n\n$$\n1+8+7+3+4+9=32,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $3.$ So, $187\\,349$ is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $3\\,121\\,557$ is\n\n$$\n3+1+2+1+5+5+7=24,\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $3.$ So, $3\\,121\\,557$ is divisible by $3.$\n\n- The sum of the digits of $99\\,125\\,041$ is\n\n$$\n9+9+1+2+5+0+4+1=31,\n$$\n\nwhich is *not* divisible by $3.$ So, $99\\,125\\,041$ is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432788 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb8fa39c-a982-569a-b2e0-833c51259711" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 3 or 9"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0120a1f8-aa48-5ed0-8305-31cbb2b1f611" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432699} {:answer/id #uuid "444908dd-fb48-51a9-b264-374c7d885080" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432718} {:answer/id #uuid "53497952-583e-5109-a21b-c6bd9897e804" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432723} {:answer/id #uuid "aebf6a52-e58b-5a25-b8d3-5595904827e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432741} {:answer/id #uuid "cd965191-d33a-5755-b2e3-4b0b273f31d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186432752}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "53497952-583e-5109-a21b-c6bd9897e804" :answer/type {:db